{"ref":"BDB, מוֹץ","hw":"מוֹץ","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹץ</span>], <span dir=\"rtl\">מֹץ</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.5\">Is 29:5</a></sup> <strong>chaff (</strong>Talm. 𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹצָא</span>, Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">مَوْصٌ</span> <em>straw</em><strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Hosea 13:3\" href=\"/Hosea.13.3\">Ho 13:3</a> + 6 times; cstr. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 17:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.17.13\">Is 17:13</a>;—<em>chaff</em>, always as driven by wind, and always c. <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּ</span>, in sim.; of wicked <a data-ref=\"Job 21:18\" href=\"/Job.21.18\">Jb 21:18</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תֶּבֶן לִפְנֵי רוּחַ</span>), cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 1:4\" href=\"/Psalms.1.4\">ψ 1:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 35:5\" href=\"/Psalms.35.5\">35:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 13:3\" href=\"/Hosea.13.3\">Ho 13:3</a>; of hostile nations <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 17:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.17.13\">Is 17:13</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(מ׳ הָרִים)</span>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.5\">29:5</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אָבָק דַּךְ</span>); hyperb. of Judah’s power, <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּבָעוֹת כַּמֹּץ תָּשִׂים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 41:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.41.15\">Is 41:15</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תָּדוּשׁ הָרִים וְתָדֹק</span>); of passing time, <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹם</span> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 2:2\" href=\"/Zephaniah.2.2\">Zp 2:2</a>.","next":"BDB, מוֹצָא³","prev":"BDB, מוץ"}